  "review_limits": [
    "One declared bounded C_RG2b quartic/profile/source/allocation and frozen completion; no generic all-C_RG2b or arbitrary-graph theorem.",
    "The full 14-dimensional continuous domain covers every parameter and every tangent direction. No future trajectory after 392 is required; floating collocation only proposed exact rational coefficients.",
    "The unique section is Lipschitz. No derivative or C1 regularity of Gamma is assumed; both physical H consumers and the section difference correction are included.",
    "Duration is 8 and elapsed target time to completion is 3136. Uniform duration 32 remains uncertified; the retained inverse obstruction is scoped to the original auxiliary completion, not every completion or the charge-21 slice.",
    "Thirteen fresh scientific/surface tests and two complete same-implementation prefix replays passed. No independent external reviewer is claimed.",
    "Superseded baseline and finite-union full payloads are absent. Their original hashes, summaries, recorded checks and generators are historical; acceptance does not claim a fresh check of absent data.",
    "Reset and read-only replay earn zero live gain. Native completion, hierarchy and G4 remain separate.",
    "SC-1 and all eight earlier accepted families are unchanged. The A_OS below 100 investigation remains paused.",
    "The broader repository audit retains pre-existing source drift at specs/README.md."
  ],
